<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-export SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/evernote-export4.dtd">
<en-export export-date="20260712T042641Z" application="Evernote" version="11.24.3">
  <note>
    <title>手順 - truetechjapan.com Webサイトへの設定</title>
    <created>20250316T095541Z</created>
    <updated>20250701T022045Z</updated>
    <note-attributes>
      <author>大塚一輝</author>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd"><en-note><div style="display:none;--en-chs:&quot;&quot;"> </div><div><br/></div><div>Prerequisite:</div><div>メールが使えるようになっている</div><div><a href="evernote:///view/2752322/s25/6c5e2957-9966-dfd4-64f7-ce30a9a89dc8/f5f04a3d-a25b-74e8-ceb9-e3e289592b70" rel="noopener noreferrer" rev="en_rl_none">Easy Email support@truetechjapan.com</a></div><div><br/></div><div>1</div><div>Aレコードをloadbalancerに向ける</div><en-media hash="836df1114dde49dd05848c511e92a137" type="image/png" style="--en-naturalWidth:339; --en-naturalHeight:424;" /><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div>2</div><h1 style="--en-nodeId:5a2d0f5b-27e1-43fc-b4e3-2848a0c51573;">2. Obtain a Certificate</h1><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>ssh supercom3L</div></div><div><br/></div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>sudo certbot certonly --manual \</div><div>     --preferred-challenges dns \</div><div>     --email support@truetechjapan.com \</div><div>     -d truetechjapan.com \</div><div>     -d '*.truetechjapan.com'</div></div><div><br/></div><div>TXT</div><div>2つセット</div><en-media hash="d836ee04b1a0bcb0fa54bcd343ea642b" type="image/png" style="--en-naturalWidth:276; --en-naturalHeight:507;" /><div>Enter</div><div><br/></div><div>Successfully received certificate. Certificate is saved at: /etc/letsencrypt/live/nntmapp.com/fullchain.pem Key is saved at:         /etc/letsencrypt/live/nntmapp.com/privkey.pem This certificate expires on 2025-06-14. These files will be updated when the certificate renews.</div><div>NEXT STEPS:</div><ul><li><div>This certificate will not be renewed automatically. Autorenewal of --manual certificates requires the use of an authentication hook script (--manual-auth-hook) but one was not provided. To renew this certificate, repeat this same certbot command before the certificate's expiry date.</div></li></ul><hr/><div>If you like Certbot, please consider supporting our work by:</div><ul><li><div>Donating to ISRG / Let's Encrypt: https://letsencrypt.org/donate</div></li><li><div>Donating to EFF: https://eff.org/donate-le</div></li></ul><hr/><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div>3</div><div>Nginx</div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>ssh supercom3L</div></div><div><br/></div><div>proxy</div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>server {</div><div>    listen 80;</div><div>    server_name truetechjapan.com www.truetechjapan.com;</div><div><br/></div><div>    return 301 https://$host$request_uri;</div><div>}</div><div><br/></div><div>server {</div><div>    listen 443 ssl;</div><div>    server_name truetechjapan.com www.truetechjapan.com;  # Include www if needed</div><div><br/></div><div>    # SSL certificate paths (update these based on Certbot output)</div><div>    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/truetechjapan.com/fullchain.pem;</div><div>    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/truetechjapan.com/privkey.pem;</div><div><br/></div><div>    client_max_body_size 75M;</div><div><br/></div><div>    location / {</div><div>        proxy_set_header Host $host;</div><div>        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;</div><div>        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;</div><div>        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;</div><div><br/></div><div>        proxy_http_version 1.1;</div><div>        proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";</div><div>        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;</div><div><br/></div><div>        proxy_pass http://192.168.1.8:8005;  # Adjust to your backend server</div><div>    }</div><div>}</div></div><div><br/></div><div>supercom2</div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div><br/></div><div># New server block for nntmapp.com (with /nntm rewrite)</div><div>server {</div><div>    listen 8005;</div><div>    server_name besttech.thinkxinc.com;</div><div><br/></div><div>    charset utf-8;</div><div>    client_max_body_size 75M;</div><div><br/></div><div>    location / {</div><div>        rewrite ^/(?!besttech)(.*)$ /besttech/$1 last;</div><div>        include uwsgi_params;</div><div>        uwsgi_pass unix:/tmp/uwsgi_thinkx.sock;</div><div>    }</div><div><br/></div><div>    location = /besttech/favicon.ico {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/favicon_NNTM.ico;</div><div>    }</div><div>    location = /besttech/robots.xml {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/robots_NNTM.txt;</div><div>    }</div><div>    location = /besttech/sitemap.xml {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/sitemap_NNTM.xml;</div><div>    }</div><div><br/></div><div>    location /besttech/img/ {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/views/img/;</div><div>    }</div><div>    location /besttech/js/ {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/views/js/;</div><div>    }</div><div>    location /besttech/css/ {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/views/css/;</div><div>    }</div><div>    location /besttech/video/ {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/views/video/;</div><div>    }</div><div>    location /besttech/fonts/ {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/views/fonts/;</div><div>    }</div><div>    location /besttech/node_modules/ {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/views/node_modules/;</div><div>    }</div><div>    location /besttech/documents/ {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/views/documents/;</div><div>    }</div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div>}</div></div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>sudo nginx -t</div></div><div><br/></div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>sudo systemctl reload nginx</div></div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div>備考</div><div>thinkxレポジトリに書かれている</div><div>webserver側のnginx (quantz-web/web-server/nginx/conf.d/thinkx.conf)  でドメインがnttmapp.comなら/nntm/に変換するようになっている</div><div><br/></div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>server {</div><div>    listen 8005;</div><div>    server_name nntmapp.com www.nntmapp.com;</div><div><br/></div><div>    charset utf-8;</div><div>    client_max_body_size 75M;</div><div><br/></div><div>    location / {</div><div>        rewrite ^/(?!nntm)(.*)$ /nntm/$1 last;</div><div>        include uwsgi_params;</div><div>        uwsgi_pass unix:/tmp/uwsgi_thinkx.sock;</div><div>    }</div><div><br/></div><div>    # Static files (mirroring nntm.thinkxinc.com)</div><div>    location = /nntm/favicon.ico {</div><div>        alias /src/thinkx/web-server/favicon_NNTM.ico;  # Use a specific favicon if desired</div><div>    }</div></div><div><br/></div><h2 style="--en-nodeId:f34dc80a-dc05-4aa3-b112-4ff4b3282795;">アクセスチェック</h2><div><br/></div><div>SSL</div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>openssl s_client -connect truetechjapan.com:443</div></div><div>Server certificate</div><div>-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----</div><div>.. -> OK</div><div><br/></div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>curl -I https://truetechjapan.com</div></div><div>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</div><div>Server: nginx/1.18.0 (Ubuntu)</div><div>Date: Tue, 01 Jul 2025 01:55:27 GMT</div><div>Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8</div><div>Content-Length: 31538</div><div>Connection: keep-alive</div><div>-> OK</div><div><br/></div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div><br/></div></div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div>Check TLS</div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>ssh supercom3L</div><div>sudo certbot certificates</div></div><div> [sudo] password for kaz: Saving debug log to /var/log/letsencrypt/letsencrypt.log</div><hr/><div>Domains: nntmapp.com *.nntmapp.com Expiry Date: 2025-06-14 </div><div>-> EXPIRED</div><div><br/></div><h2 style="--en-nodeId:93795677-192e-4285-a3b7-cab0bbaee2c4;">TLS 更新</h2><div><br/></div><div style="--en-codeblock:true; --en-lineWrapping:false;box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;,&quot;Consolas&quot;,&quot;Monaco&quot;,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-top-left-radius: 4px; border-top-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; background-color: rgb(251, 250, 248); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14902); background-position: initial initial; background-repeat: initial initial;"><div>sudo certbot certonly --manual \</div><div>    --preferred-challenges dns \</div><div>    --email support@truetechjapan.com \</div><div>    -d truetechjapan.com \</div><div>    -d '*.truetechjapan.com'</div></div><div><br/></div><div>-> Route 53のvalueを差し替え</div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div><div><br/></div></en-note>      ]]>
    </content>
